	"FriendlyName": "FogMS Volumetric Fog Multiple Scattering (MultiLobeSpec)",
	"Description": "UE 5.8, Win64 D3D12 SM6 with hardware ray tracing. FogMS Box volume: multiple scattering and self-shadowing for native Volumetric Fog, delivered through Emissive Injection in the Box's Volume material (runtime and packaged games; no engine modification, no -BindlessAll). Editor-only research tools: MultiLobeSpec shader overlay (dual-lobe GGX, material micro-shadowing, visibility baking) and the bindless FogMS overlay modes.",
